  "id": "disorganized-attachment",
  "term": "disorganized attachment",
  "definition": "Disorganized attachment is a type of infant attachment discussed as being linked to later controlling behavior in relationships. In the source, some children with disorganized attachment are associated with more punitive-controlling behavior, while others are associated with more caregiving-controlling behavior.",
